<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves fall to 70.03 bln rgt.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves fall to 70.03 bln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves fell to 70.03 billion ringgit as at December 31, compared with 70.10 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities fell</p>
<p>to 96.74 billion ringgit from 97.58 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p>(In bln ringgit) Dec 31 1996    Dec 14 1996	Dec 30 1995</p>
<p>Reserves	    70.03	     70.10		63.80</p>
<p>Assets		96.74	     97.58		88.48</p>
<p>Currency	    21.07	     20.58		18.91</p>
<p>Govt paper	   3.12		3.27		 2.16</p>
</text>
